    },
    {
      "id": "z1owfqi",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. DIRECT TAXES IN DETAIL"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qox4pi0",
      "content": "Income Tax:<br></br>• Levied on individual income.<br></br>• Progressive tax system.<br></br><br></br>Corporate Tax:<br></br>• Levied on company profits.<br></br><br></br>Capital Gains Tax:<br></br>• Levied on gains from sale of assets."
    },
    {
      "id": "6az01ww",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
