            "<p>Tax on sale of assets</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mrb7nd1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. INDIRECT TAXES IN DETAIL"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yfbf1g5",
      "content": "GST:<br></br>• Implemented on 1 July 2017.<br></br>• Destination-based tax.<br></br>• Replaced VAT, Service Tax and many others.<br></br><br></br>Customs Duty:<br></br>• Levied on imports and exports.<br></br><br></br>Excise Duty:<br></br>• Levied on manufacture (petroleum, alcohol excluded from GST)."
    },
